logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Runtime data
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# IDE and editor files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*.bak

